self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#1-despliegue-manual-con-helm","content":"Es la opción recomendada para entornos productivos o controlados, donde PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, Keycloak, certificados y direccionamiento del Gateway ya están definidos por el equipo de plataforma."},"305":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-48","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#2-despliegue-automatizado-con-fastlane","content":"Es la opción más útil para pruebas, demos, CI o bootstrap rápido de un entorno. Fastlane levanta PostgreSQL, Keycloak, RabbitMQ y Lamassu en un único flujo. Su comportamiento está documentado en la página siguiente."},"306":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-49","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#arquitectura","content":"Lamassu IoT se despliega como un conjunto de microservicios Kubernetes independientes. El chart principal crea `Deployment`, `StatefulSet`, `Service`, `ConfigMap`, `HTTPRoute`, `Gateway`, certificados y recursos auxiliares según los valores definidos."},"307":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-50","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#arquitectura","content":"Dependencias externas requeridas por el chart principal:"},"308":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-51","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#arquitectura","content":"PostgreSQL"},"309":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-52","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#arquitectura","content":"RabbitMQ"},"310":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-53","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#arquitectura","content":"proveedor OIDC, típicamente Keycloak"},"311":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-54","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#arquitectura","content":"El chart no instala estas dependencias por sí solo. Para un despliegue manual hay que provisionarlas antes. Si se busca un entorno funcional rápido para laboratorio o validación, el script Fastlane sí instala PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ y Keycloak además del chart de Lamassu."},"312":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-55","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#instalación-manual-con-helm","content":"Agregar el repositorio Helm:"},"313":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-56","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#instalación-manual-con-helm","content":"O instalar desde una copia local del repositorio:"},"314":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-57","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#valores-mínimos-que-deben-definirse","content":"Los valores por defecto del chart son deliberadamente incompletos para dependencias externas. Como mínimo, un despliegue manual debe definir:"},"315":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-58","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#valores-mínimos-que-deben-definirse","content":"`postgres.hostname`, `postgres.username`, `postgres.password`"},"316":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-59","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#valores-mínimos-que-deben-definirse","content":"