page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"No hay un superusuario implícito. Antes de instalar, crea el rol `pki-admin` en el proveedor OIDC y asígnalo al grupo que administrará Lamassu. El principal del ejemplo concede la política `SUPER ADMIN` a cualquier token que contenga ese rol."},"325":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-68","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"El Job `pre-install` y `pre-upgrade` prepara las bases de datos, ejecuta las migraciones de authz, precarga las políticas y aplica `services.authz.bootstrap` antes de que arranquen los Deployments. El bootstrap es idempotente: conserva los principales existentes y añade únicamente los grants que falten."},"326":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-69","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Si ningún token coincide con un principal activo, nadie podrá administrar la PKI. Prueba una identidad autorizada y otra denegada, y conserva un procedimiento de recuperación."},"327":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-70","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Consulta Control de acceso para diseñar principales y políticas."},"328":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-71","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#áreas-de-configuración-más-relevantes","content":"**TLS:** `tls.type`, `tls.certManagerOptions.*` y `tls.externalOptions.secretName` controlan el certificado *downstream* del Gateway."},"329":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-72","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#áreas-de-configuración-más-relevantes","content":"**Gateway:** `gateway.addresses`, `gateway.ports.*` y `gateway.extraRouting` publican la UI y las APIs mediante Envoy Gateway."},"330":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-73","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#áreas-de-configuración-más-relevantes","content":"**Persistencia:** `postgres.*` define la conexión a PostgreSQL."},"331":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-74","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#áreas-de-configuración-más-relevantes","content":"**Mensajería:** `amqp.*` configura la conexión a RabbitMQ."},"332":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-75","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#áreas-de-configuración-más-relevantes","content":"**Identidad y autorización:** `auth.oidc.*`, `services.authz.jwkUrl` y `services.authz.bootstrap` configuran login, validación JWT y permisos iniciales."},"333":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-76","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#áreas-de-configuración-más-relevantes","content":"**Autoridades:** `services.ca.domains` establece los dominios autorizados para CA y certificados."},"334":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-77","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#áreas-de-configuración-más-relevantes","content":"**Claves:** `services.kms.cryptoEngines.*` configura los motores criptográficos y su almacenamiento."},"335":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-78","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#áreas-de-configuración-más-relevantes","content":"**Alertas:** `services.alerts.smtp_server.*` prepara el envío de correo."},"336":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-79","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#verificación-del-despliegue","content":"El chart incluye una prueba Helm en `charts/lamassu/templates/tests/test-connections.yml`. Tras instalarlo, puede validarse con:"},"337":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-80","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#verificación-del-despliegue","content":"La prueba comprueba al menos:"},"338":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-81","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#verificación-del-despliegue","content":"salud de `ca`"},"339":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-82","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#verificación-del-despliegue","content":"salud de `dms-manager`"},"340":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-83","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#verificación-del-despliegue","content":"salud de `device-manager`"},"341":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-84","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#verificación-del-despliegue","content":"salud de `va`"},"342":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-85","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#verificación-del-despliegue","content":"respuesta HTML esperada del servicio `ui`"},"343":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-86","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#repositorio-helm","content":"El repositorio `lamassu-helm` está organizado en tres bloques principales:"},"344":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-87","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#repositorio-helm","content":"`charts/lamassu`: chart principal de Lamassu"},"345":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-88","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#repositorio-helm","content":"`charts/softhsm`: chart opcional para laboratorios o escenarios de integración con PKCS#11 emulado"},"346":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-89","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#repositorio-helm","content":"`scripts/lamassu-fast-lane.sh`: automatización para levantar dependencias y desplegar Lamassu con intervención mínima"},"347":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-90","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#softhsm-como-complemento-opcional","content":"El chart `charts/softhsm` no forma parte del despliegue estándar, pero resulta útil en entornos de laboratorio cuando se necesita simular un HSM compatible con PKCS#11. No sustituye al backend KMS principal; sirve como soporte para pruebas o integraciones concretas."},"348":{"id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview-91","page_id":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/overview#versionado-y-migraciones","content":"La versión actual del chart en el repositorio es `3.8.0`. Para upgrades entre versiones, consulta las guías de `charts/lamassu/CHANGELOG/` y revisa especialmente las migraciones de base de datos y el bootstrap de authz."},"349":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","type":"page","content":"Control de acceso","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Administrar Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control"},"350":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-0","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","content":"Conecta una identidad OIDC o X.509 con principales, políticas y permisos de Lamassu."},"351":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-1","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#cómo-se-toma-una-decisión","content":"Cómo se toma una decisión"},"352":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-2","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#principales","content":"Principales"},"353":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-3","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#políticas","content":"Políticas"},"354":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-4","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Provisiona el primer administrador"},"355":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-5","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#bootstrap-de-fastlane","content":"Bootstrap de Fastlane"},"356":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-6","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#operación-segura","content":"Operación segura"},"357":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-7","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#diagnóstico-rápido","content":"Diagnóstico rápido"},"358":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-8","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","content":"Lamassu separa autenticación y autorización. El proveedor OIDC o el certificado cliente demuestra quién realiza la petición; el servicio authz relaciona esa identidad con uno o varios principales y decide qué acciones están permitidas."},"359":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-9","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#cómo-se-toma-una-decisión","content":"El Gateway valida la autenticación configurada, normalmente un JWT mediante JWKS."},"360":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-10","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#cómo-se-toma-una-decisión","content":"Envoy envía la petición al endpoint de autorización externa /v1/ext\\_authz/check."},"361":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-11","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#cómo-se-toma-una-decisión","content":"authz compara las credenciales con principales activos."},"362":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-12","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#cómo-se-toma-una-decisión","content":"Reúne las políticas concedidas a los principales coincidentes."},"363":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-13","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#cómo-se-toma-una-decisión","content":"Evalúa la acción HTTP o el recurso solicitado y permite o deniega."},"364":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-14","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#cómo-se-toma-una-decisión","content":"Por defecto, auth.externalAuthorization.failOpen es false. Si authz no responde, el Gateway bloquea la petición protegida."},"365":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-15","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#principales","content":"Un principal representa una identidad autorizable, no necesariamente una persona individual. Tiene un identificador estable, nombre, tipo, configuración de coincidencia, estado activo y políticas concedidas."},"366":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-16","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#principales","content":"Lamassu admite dos tipos:"},"367":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-17","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#principales","content":"**oidc**: coincide con claims de un token, por ejemplo un rol, grupo o preferred\\_username."},"368":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-18","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#principales","content":"**x509**: coincide con una identidad autenticada mediante certificado y su configuración de confianza."},"369":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-19","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#principales","content":"Diseña los principales alrededor de identidades estables del proveedor. Para administración humana suele ser preferible un grupo o rol gestionado centralmente; para automatización, usa una identidad técnica independiente."},"370":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-20","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#políticas","content":"Una política agrupa reglas reutilizables. Las reglas pueden:"},"371":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-21","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#políticas","content":"permitir acciones sobre un tipo de entidad;"},"372":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-22","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#políticas","content":"limitar el acceso a identificadores concretos;"},"373":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-23","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#políticas","content":"seguir relaciones entre entidades;"},"374":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-24","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#políticas","content":"aplicar filtros por atributos;"},"375":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-25","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#políticas","content":"conceder acciones HTTP lógicas definidas por el esquema de una API."},"376":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-26","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#políticas","content":"La acción \\* en una regla HTTP concede todas las acciones definidas por ese esquema. Resérvala para roles administrativos controlados."},"377":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-27","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Una instalación sin un principal que coincida con tu identidad queda sin nadie capaz de administrar la PKI. Define el bootstrap y configura el IdP antes de exponer la plataforma."},"378":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-28","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"El chart crea por defecto un principal que busca el rol OIDC pki-admin en realm\\_access.roles y le concede las políticas de administración incluidas. El Job Helm de preinstalación y preactualización ejecuta las migraciones de authz, precarga las políticas y crea los principales de bootstrap antes de iniciar los servicios."},"379":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-29","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Antes de instalar:"},"380":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-30","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Crea el rol pki-admin en tu proveedor OIDC."},"381":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-31","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Asígnalo a un grupo administrativo pequeño y verificable."},"382":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-32","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Configura la URL JWKS interna que alcanzará authz."},"383":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-33","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Mantén al menos dos identidades humanas de recuperación."},"384":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-34","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Prueba acceso permitido y denegado con usuarios distintos."},"385":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-35","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"El bootstrap es idempotente: si el principal ya existe, no lo reemplaza; solo añade las políticas configuradas que todavía falten. Por eso puedes mantenerlo en values.yaml durante las actualizaciones."},"386":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-36","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#bootstrap-de-fastlane","content":"Fastlane instala un realm de Keycloak para laboratorio y crea el usuario lamassu con contraseña temporal lamassu, rol pki-admin y acción obligatoria de cambio de contraseña. Su principal de bootstrap coincide por preferred\\_username=lamassu."},"387":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-37","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#bootstrap-de-fastlane","content":"Cambia la contraseña en el primer acceso. No reutilices este usuario ni el IdP de ejemplo como diseño de producción."},"388":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-38","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#operación-segura","content":"Concede políticas a grupos o identidades técnicas, no a claims ambiguos."},"389":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-39","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#operación-segura","content":"Desactiva un principal cuando deba perder acceso de inmediato."},"390":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-40","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#operación-segura","content":"Separa administración de PKI, operación de dispositivos y automatizaciones."},"391":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-41","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#operación-segura","content":"Revisa los grants tras cambios en el proveedor OIDC."},"392":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-42","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#operación-segura","content":"Mantén failOpen: false salvo una decisión de riesgo explícita."},"393":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-43","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#operación-segura","content":"Conserva un procedimiento probado para recuperar acceso sin desactivar autorización."},"394":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-44","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#diagnóstico-rápido","content":"Un 401 suele indicar que el Gateway no pudo validar la autenticación. Revisa emisor, audiencia, expiración y JWKS."},"395":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-45","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#diagnóstico-rápido","content":"Un 403 indica normalmente que la identidad se autenticó, pero ningún principal activo y sus políticas autorizaron la acción. Comprueba claims reales del token, regla de coincidencia, grants y acción solicitada."},"396":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control-46","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/access-control#diagnóstico-rápido","content":"Si todas las rutas protegidas fallan, verifica la salud y conectividad de authz, su acceso a PostgreSQL y la URL JWKS. Continúa con Resolución de problemas."},"397":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","type":"page","content":"Alertas y suscripciones","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Operar Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts"},"398":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-0","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","content":"Envía eventos de la PKI a personas y sistemas externos."},"399":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-1","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#cómo-funciona","content":"Cómo funciona"},"400":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-2","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#canales-disponibles","content":"Canales disponibles"},"401":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-3","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#crea-una-suscripción","content":"Crea una suscripción"},"402":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-4","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#elige-el-evento","content":"Elige el evento"},"403":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-5","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#configura-el-destino","content":"Configura el destino"},"404":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-6","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#limita-las-notificaciones","content":"Limita las notificaciones"},"405":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-7","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#revisa-y-activa","content":"Revisa y activa"},"406":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-8","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#gestiona-una-suscripción","content":"Gestiona una suscripción"},"407":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-9","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#familias-de-eventos","content":"Familias de eventos"},"408":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-10","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","content":"Las suscripciones convierten los eventos de Lamassu en notificaciones accionables. Puedes avisar a un equipo, alimentar un sistema de incidentes o activar una automatización cuando cambia una CA, un certificado o un dispositivo."},"409":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-11","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#cómo-funciona","content":"Un servicio publica un evento de dominio."},"410":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-12","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#cómo-funciona","content":"Lamassu evalúa las suscripciones asociadas a ese tipo de evento."},"411":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-13","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#cómo-funciona","content":"El filtro de cada suscripción decide si debe notificarse."},"412":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-14","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#cómo-funciona","content":"Lamassu entrega el evento al canal configurado."},"413":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-15","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#cómo-funciona","content":"El inventario de eventos muestra cuándo se observó cada tipo por última vez, cuántas veces ha ocurrido y cuántas suscripciones tiene. Puedes expandir un evento para inspeccionar un ejemplo de su payload JSON antes de crear el filtro."},"414":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-16","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#canales-disponibles","content":"**Email** envía avisos a una persona o lista operativa. Solo requiere la dirección de destino."},"415":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-17","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#canales-disponibles","content":"**Microsoft Teams** publica la notificación en un canal mediante su URL de webhook."},"416":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-18","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#canales-disponibles","content":"**Webhook** entrega el evento a una automatización, SIEM o sistema de incidentes mediante `POST` o `PUT`."},"417":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-19","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#elige-el-evento","content":"Abre **Alerts**, localiza el tipo de evento y selecciona **Subscribe**. Revisa el último ejemplo JSON para identificar los campos que necesitarás filtrar."},"418":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-20","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#configura-el-destino","content":"Selecciona Email, Microsoft Teams o Webhook e introduce los datos del canal."},"419":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-21","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#limita-las-notificaciones","content":"Añade un filtro si no quieres recibir todas las instancias del evento."},"420":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-22","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#limita-las-notificaciones","content":"**None** notifica todas las instancias del evento."},"421":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-23","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#limita-las-notificaciones","content":"**JSON Path** evalúa uno o varios campos concretos."},"422":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts-24","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/alerts#limita-las-notificaciones","content":"**JSON Schema** acepta únicamente payloads con una estructur