ity#selecciona-la-clave","content":"Selecciona la clave"},"1576":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-4","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad","content":"Define la autoridad"},"1577":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-5","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#revisa-y-crea-la-ca","content":"Revisa y crea la CA"},"1578":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-6","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#verifica-el-resultado","content":"Verifica el resultado"},"1579":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-7","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#siguiente-paso","content":"Siguiente paso"},"1580":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-8","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","content":"En este quickstart crearás una autoridad de certificación raíz con un nuevo par de claves. Al terminar tendrás una CA activa que podrás usar en el siguiente quickstart."},"1581":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-9","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#antes-de-empezar","content":"Acceso a la consola con permisos para gestionar autoridades."},"1582":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-10","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#antes-de-empezar","content":"Al menos un motor criptográfico disponible."},"1583":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-11","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un nombre que identifique el propósito de la CA, por ejemplo `Acme Device Root CA`."},"1584":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-12","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#antes-de-empezar","content":"Una CA raíz se autofirma y actúa como ancla de confianza. Para producción suele ser preferible mantener la raíz más protegida y emitir desde una CA intermedia."},"1585":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-13","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#abre-el-asistente-de-creación","content":"En el menú lateral, abre **Certification Authorities** y selecciona **Create New CA**."},"1586":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-14","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#abre-el-asistente-de-creación","content":"Elige crear una CA con un par de claves nuevo. Si ya tienes la clave en el KMS, usa &#x2A;*Create New CA (Existing Key)**."},"1587":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-15","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#selecciona-la-clave","content":"Elige el motor criptográfico que custodiará la clave y configura el algoritmo. Para una primera CA puedes usar **EC P-384**, siempre que sea compatible con tus consumidores."},"1588":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-16","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#selecciona-la-clave","content":"La clave privada permanecerá bajo el control del motor seleccionado."},"1589":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-17","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad","content":"Selecciona **Root CA** y completa:"},"1590":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-18","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad","content":"**CA Name**: un nombre único y reconocible."},"1591":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-19","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad","content":"**Subject**: al menos la organización y el país que identificarán a la autoridad."},"1592":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-20","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad","content":"**CA Certificate Expiration**: una validez mayor que la de los certificados que emitirá."},"1593":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-21","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad","content":"**Default End-Entity Certificate Issuance Expiration**: la validez predeterminada de los certificados finales."},"1594":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-22","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad","content":"El nombre de la CA se utilizará como `Common Name` del certificado."},"1595":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-23","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#revisa-y-crea-la-ca","content":"Comprueba el algoritmo, el sujeto y las fechas antes de confirmar. Estos valores definen el ancla de confianza y no deberían elegirse como simples datos de prueba en un entorno productivo."},"1596":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-24","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#verifica-el-resultado","content":"Abre la nueva CA desde el listado. Debe aparecer activa y mostrar su certificado PEM, la fecha de expiración y la pestaña **Issued Certificates**."},"1597":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-25","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#siguiente-paso","content":"Usa la autoridad para emitir tu primer certificado, o consulta la guía completa de autoridades para crear una CA intermedia, importar una CA o definir perfiles avanzados."},"1598":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"page","content":"Emite tu primer certificado","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Primeros pasos"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate"},"1599":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-0","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","content":"Emite una identidad X.509 desde la consola y verifica el resultado."},"1600":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-1","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"Antes de empezar"},"1601":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-2","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#inicia-la-emisión","content":"Inicia la emisión"},"1602":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-3","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#elige-el-método","content":"Elige el método"},"1603":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-4","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#identifica-el-certificado","content":"Identifica el certificado"},"1604":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-5","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#configura-clave-y-usos","content":"Configura clave y usos"},"1605":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-6","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#emite-y-descarga","content":"Emite y descarga"},"1606":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-7","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verifica-el-resultado","content":"Verifica el resultado"},"1607":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-8","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#siguiente-paso","content":"Siguiente paso"},"1608":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-9","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","content":"En este quickstart Lamassu generará la clave y el CSR en el navegador, y la CA emitirá el certificado. Al terminar descargarás el certificado y su clave privada."},"1609":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-10","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"Una CA activa con permiso para emitir certificados."},"1610":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-11","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un nombre para la identidad, por ejemplo `device-001.example.internal`."},"1611":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-12","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un lugar seguro en el que custodiar la clave privada descargada."},"1612":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-13","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"En este flujo la clave se genera en el navegador y Lamassu no la almacena. Descárgala y protégela antes de cerrar el resultado de la operación."},"1613":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-14","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#inicia-la-emisión","content":"Abre la CA creada en el quickstart anterior, entra en **Issued Certificates** y selecciona **Issue New**."},"1614":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-15","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#elige-el-método","content":"Selecciona **Generate Key & CSR in Browser**. Usa **Upload Existing CSR** cuando la clave privada deba generarse y permanecer en el sistema de destino."},"1615":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-16","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#identifica-el-certificado","content":"Introduce el `Common Name` y, si corresponde, la organización, unidad organizativa y ubicación. Añade SANs para cada nombre DNS, dirección IP, correo o URI con el que se vaya a validar la identidad."},"1616":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-17","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#configura-clave-y-usos","content":"Elige RSA o ECDSA, define la validez y selecciona los usos de clave. Para una identidad de dispositivo que usa mTLS, habilita **Digital Signature** y **Client Authentication**."},"1617":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-18","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#configura-clave-y-usos","content":"La validez no puede superar la fecha de expiración de la CA emisora."},"1618":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-19","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#emite-y-descarga","content":"Confirma la emisión y descarga inmediatamente el certificado y la clave privada en formato PEM."},"1619":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-20","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verifica-el-resultado","content":"El certificado debe aparecer en **Issued Certificates** con estado activo. Comprueba su sujeto, SANs, emisor, usos y periodo de validez."},"1620":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-21","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#siguiente-paso","content":"Registra tu primer dispositivo para asociar la identidad a una entidad gestionada, o consulta la gestión de certificados."},"1621":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","type":"page","content":"Primeros pasos","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Primeros pasos"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview"},"1622":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-0","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","content":"Obtén un primer resultado con Lamassu y continúa desde una base funcional."},"1623":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-1","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#ruta-recomendada","content":"Ruta recomendada"},"1624":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-2","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#antes-de-empezar","content":"Antes de empezar"},"1625":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-3","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","content":"Los quickstarts te llevan desde una instancia preparada hasta una identidad de dispositivo activa. Cada guía produce un resultado verificable y enlaza la explicación detallada cuando necesitas ir más allá."},"1626":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-4","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#ruta-recomendada","content":"<Card title=\"1. Crea tu primera CA\" description=\"Establece una raíz de confianza capaz de emitir certificados.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority\" />"},"1627":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-5","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#ruta-recomendada","content":"<Card title=\"2. Emite un certificado\" description=\"Crea una identidad X.509 y verifica su contenido.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate\" />"},"1628":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-6","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#ruta-recomendada","content":"<Card title=\"3. Registra un dispositivo\" description=\"Añade un dispositivo y asígnale su primera identidad.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device\" />"},"1629":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-7","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#antes-de-empezar","content":"Necesitas acceso a la consola de Lamassu IoT y permisos para administrar claves, autoridades y dispositivos. La instancia debe tener al menos un motor criptográfico configurado."},"1630":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-8","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#antes-de-empezar","content":"Si todavía no tienes una instancia, elige primero un modelo de despliegue."},"1631":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","type":"page","content":"Registra tu primer dispositivo","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Primeros pasos"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device"},"1632":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-0","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","content":"Añade un dispositivo a Lamassu y asígnale una identidad activa."},"1633":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-1","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Antes de empezar"},"1634":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-2","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"Registra el dispositivo"},"1635":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-3","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#comprueba-el-estado-inicial","content":"Comprueba el estado inicial"},"1636":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-4","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#asigna-una-identidad","content":"Asigna una identidad"},"1637":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-5","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#verifica-el-dispositivo","content":"Verifica el dispositivo"},"1638":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-6","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#automatiza-el-siguiente-dispositivo","content":"Automatiza el siguiente dispositivo"},"1639":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-7","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","content":"En este quickstart registrarás manualmente un dispositivo y le asignarás su primer certificado. Es el recorrido más corto para entender cómo Lamassu relaciona una entidad física con su historial de identidades."},"1640":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-8","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un DMS configurado."},"1641":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-9","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Una CA asociada al DMS."},"1642":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-10","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un identificador único para el dispositivo."},"1643":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-11","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"Abre **Managed Devices**, selecciona la acción para registrar un dispositivo y completa:"},"1644":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-12","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"**Device ID**: identificador único del dispositivo."},"1645":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-13","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"**Registration Authority**: DMS que aplicará las políticas de enrolamiento."},"1646":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-14","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"**Icon** y **Tags**: clasificación opcional para localizarlo después."},"1647":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-15","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#comprueba-el-estado-inicial","content":"Abre el dispositivo recién creado. Debe aparecer con estado **No Identity**: existe en el inventario, pero todavía no tiene un certificado asociado."},"1648":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-16","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#asigna-una-identidad","content":"Selecciona **Assign Identity**. Lamassu buscará certificados activos cuyo `Common Name` coincida con el `Device ID`."},"1649":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-17","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#asigna-una-identidad","content":"Selecciona un certificado existente o usa **Issue New Instead** para emitir uno desde una CA vinculada al DMS."},"1650":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-18","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#verifica-el-dispositivo","content":"Tras confirmar, el estado debe cambiar a **Active**. Revisa **Certificate History** para comprobar la identidad asociada y **Device Event Timeline** para ver el evento de asignación."},"1651":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device-19","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device#automatiza-el-siguiente-dispositivo","content":"El registro manual ayuda a entender el modelo, pero una flota debe usar enrolamiento automatizado. Continúa con Device Management Service y la integración EST."},"1652":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"Resolución de problemas","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Administrar Lamassu"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting"},"1653":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","content":"Diagnostica acceso, salud, emisión, enrolamiento y dependencias en un despliegue de Lamassu."},"1654":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#secuencia-de-diagnóstico","content":"Secuencia de diagnóstico"},"1655":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-2","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#reproduce-una-sola-operación","content":"Reproduce una sola operación"},"1656":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-3","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#separa-cliente-gateway-y-servicio","content":"Separa cliente, Gateway y servicio"},"1657":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-4","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#revisa-el-estado-de-kubernetes","content":"Revisa el estado de Kubernetes"},"1658":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-5","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#consulta-el-servicio-afectado","content":"Consulta el servicio afectado"},"1659":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-6","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#valida-el-resultado-desde-fuera","content":"Valida el resultado desde fuera"},"1660":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-7","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Recogida mínima de evidencias"},"1661":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-8","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"No puedo iniciar sesión"},"1662":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Todo devuelve 403 o 5xx"},"1663":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"Un pod no está Ready"},"1664":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"La emisión falla"},"1665":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#el-enrolamiento-est-falla","content":"El enrolamiento EST falla"},"1666":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-o-crl-no-reflejan-un-cambio","content":"OCSP o CRL no reflejan un cambio"},"1667":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"Los eventos no llegan"},"1668":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"Observabilidad"},"1669":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","content":"Empieza por localizar la capa que falla. Una respuesta del Gateway, un pod no preparado y una emisión rechazada pueden parecer el mismo problema desde la consola, pero requieren evidencias distintas."},"1670":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#reproduce-una-sola-operación","content":"Anota hora en UTC, usuario o principal, recurso, endpoint y resultado. Evita repetir una acción destructiva como revocación o eliminación."},"1671":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#separa-cliente-gateway-y-servicio","content":"Comprueba el código HTTP. Un 401 apunta a autenticación; un 403, a autorización; un 404, a ruta o recurso; un 5xx, al servicio o una dependencia."},"1672":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#revisa-el-estado-de-kubernetes","content":"Localiza pods no preparados, reinicios, eventos recientes y el estado del release."},"1673":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#consulta-el-servicio-afectado","content":"Revisa su endpoint /health y sus logs en la misma ventana temporal. Después sigue la dependencia indicada: PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, proveedor OIDC o motor criptográfico."},"1674":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#valida-el-resultado-desde-fuera","content":"Para PKI, comprueba el certificado, la cadena, OCSP o CRL con el mismo tipo de cliente que utiliza producción."},"1675":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Sustituye los marcadores por tu release, namespace y deployment reales."},"1676":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Ejecuta también la prueba de conectividad del chart:"},"1677":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"El test consulta la salud de CA, DMS Manager, Device Manager y VA, y comprueba que la UI devuelve HTML. Un test correcto confirma conectividad básica, no un flujo completo de emisión."},"1678":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Los servicios del chart exponen sondas de inicio, disponibilidad y vida sobre /health. Un pod puede estar ejecutándose pero no recibir tráfico si la readiness probe falla."},"1679":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"Si recibes un 401:"},"1680":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"comprueba que la autoridad OIDC de la UI sea accesible desde el navegador;"},"1681":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"verifica emisor, audiencia y expiración del token;"},"1682":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"confirma que el Gateway puede obtener las claves de la URI JWKS;"},"1683":{"id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/platform/pki/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"revisa que la ruta pública e interna del proveedor apunten al mismo realm."},"1684